"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Wiederholung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">R5</div><h1>통합 복습 5</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wiederholung 5 · Lektion 38–46</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 38부터 46까지 배운 문법을 섞어서 풀어요.<br>여러 과의 문법이 한 문장에 함께 나와요. 기본 9 · 중간 9 · 도전 9 문제예요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 복습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">종속절 · dass 문장과 명사구를 서로 바꿔요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">기능동사 구문 · 분사구 · 수동의 대체 표현을 알맞게 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">화법조동사 바꿔 쓰기, 양보와 조건, 어순, 2격을 섞어서 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"1a6a86b5cc\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> seiner Verletzung spielte er bis zum Schluss weiter.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Trotz</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Dank</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">c) Mangels</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) Wegen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">다쳤는데도 계속 뛰었어요 → 양보의 trotz + 2격. obwohl er verletzt war를 줄인 꼴이에요 (38과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d9aac605fb\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;der&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Zuschauer sind begeistert.<br>→ die Begeisterung <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(2격 복수 관사)</span> Zuschauer</div><div class=\"qko\">관객들이 열광해요. → 관객들의 열광</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Zuschauer sind begeistert.<br>→ die Begeisterung <b>der</b> Zuschauer</div>목적어가 없는 문장은 주어가 2격이 돼요 (39과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b906885a4b\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Die Kommission hat gestern einen Beschluss <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) genommen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) gestellt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) gemacht</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) gefasst</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'결의하다'는 einen Beschluss fassen이에요 (40과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"904b82f464\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gefallenen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> die Äpfel, die vom Baum gefallen sind<br>→ die vom Baum <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:12ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(fallen · 분사 + 어미)</span> Äpfel</div><div class=\"qko\">나무에서 떨어진 사과들</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · die Äpfel, die vom Baum gefallen sind<br>→ die vom Baum <b>gefallenen</b> Äpfel</div>sein과 완료형을 만드는 동사의 과거분사는 끝난 일을 나타내요. 정관사 뒤 복수는 -en이에요 (41과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6a980636c0\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Die Akten <span class=\"qblank\"></span> sich nicht mehr finden.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) sind</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) haben</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) lassen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">d) werden</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich lassen + 원형 = ~될 수 있다. Die Akten können nicht mehr gefunden werden과 뜻이 같아요 (42과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"6394061a76\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;gestattet&quot;,&quot;erlaubt&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> Kinder unter zwölf Jahren dürfen das Schwimmbad nicht allein besuchen.<br>= Es ist Kindern unter zwölf Jahren nicht <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(허락)</span>, das Schwimmbad allein zu besuchen.</div><div class=\"qko\">열두 살이 안 된 아이는 혼자 수영장에 갈 수 없어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Kinder unter zwölf Jahren dürfen das Schwimmbad nicht allein besuchen.<br>= Es ist Kindern unter zwölf Jahren nicht <b>gestattet</b>, das Schwimmbad allein zu besuchen.</div>nicht dürfen = es ist nicht gestattet · erlaubt, … zu (43과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"287dabdb8f\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Sie noch Fragen haben, schreiben Sie uns einfach.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Sollten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) Hätten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) Sollte</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Wären</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sollte로 시작하는 조건문은 '혹시 ~한다면'이에요. 주어가 Sie라서 Sollten이에요 (44과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0b5dc87af7\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Brauchst du den Stift noch? – Nein, ich gebe <span class=\"qblank\"></span> gleich zurück.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) ihn dir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) dir ihn</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) es dir</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) dir es</button></div><div class=\"qe\">대명사끼리는 4격(ihn)이 3격(dir)보다 앞에 와요. der Stift는 남성이라서 ihn이에요 (45과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"18534a837a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Meines&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(내가 알기로)</span> Wissens öffnet die Bibliothek sonntags nicht.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 알기로 도서관은 일요일에 문을 열지 않아요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Meines</b> Wissens öffnet die Bibliothek sonntags nicht.</div>meines Wissens = 내가 알기로는. 2격의 굳은 표현이에요 (46과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"8d1bf1f8b8\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wegen der großen Nachfrage stellt die Firma neue Leute ein.&quot;,&quot;Aufgrund der großen Nachfrage stellt die Firma neue Leute ein.&quot;,&quot;Die Firma stellt wegen der großen Nachfrage neue Leute ein.&quot;,&quot;Die Firma stellt aufgrund der großen Nachfrage neue Leute ein.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 종속절을 전치사구로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Weil die Nachfrage groß ist, stellt die Firma neue Leute ein.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 10\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wegen der großen Nachfrage stellt die Firma neue Leute ein.</b></div>weil → wegen + 2격. 서술어 groß는 명사 앞에서 형용사 어미를 받아요 (38과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"5b66ea8cd1\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> 'Der Verlag veröffentlicht den Roman.'을 명사구로 바르게 바꾼 것은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) die Veröffentlichung des Romans durch den Verlag</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) die Veröffentlichung den Roman durch den Verlag</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) die Veröffentlichung des Verlags durch den Roman</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) die Veröffentlichung des Romans von den Verlag</button></div><div class=\"qe\">4격 목적어는 2격으로, 일을 한 쪽은 durch + 4격으로 옮겨요 (39과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"017947de95\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;an&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Der Vorschlag wird von vielen Experten kritisiert.<br>→ Viele Experten üben Kritik <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(전치사)</span> dem Vorschlag.</div><div class=\"qko\">많은 전문가가 그 제안을 비판해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Vorschlag wird von vielen Experten kritisiert.<br>→ Viele Experten üben Kritik <b>an</b> dem Vorschlag.</div>kritisieren = Kritik üben an + 3격 (40과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fde16c1d1e\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> die Aufgaben, die noch erledigt werden müssen<br>→ die noch <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Aufgaben</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) erledigten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) erledigenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">c) zu erledigenden</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) zu erledigten</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'~되어야 할'은 zu + 현재분사예요 (41과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"499e83c42c\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hätten&quot;],[&quot;werden&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Man hätte die Gäste früher abholen müssen.<br>→ Die Gäste <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(접속법 II)</span> früher abgeholt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(수동)</span> müssen.</div><div class=\"qko\">손님들을 더 일찍 데리러 갔어야 했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Man hätte die Gäste früher abholen müssen.<br>→ Die Gäste <b>hätten</b> früher abgeholt <b>werden</b> müssen.</div>hätte + 과거분사 + werden + müssen. 주어가 복수라서 hätten이에요 (42과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9a38d44255\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Der Verein will das alte Clubhaus verkaufen.<br>= Der Verein <span class=\"qblank\"></span>, das alte Clubhaus zu verkaufen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) ist imstande</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">b) beabsichtigt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) ist gezwungen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) ist berechtigt</button></div><div class=\"qe\">계획의 wollen = beabsichtigen, … zu (43과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c674dcc45a\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auch&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> So kalt es <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ist, er geht jeden Morgen schwimmen.</div><div class=\"qko\">아무리 추워도 그는 아침마다 수영하러 가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · So kalt es <b>auch</b> ist, er geht jeden Morgen schwimmen.</div>so + 형용사 … auch = 아무리 ~해도 (44과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"694a8e81c3\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Wir sind am Ende doch nicht nach Italien gefahren&quot;,&quot;Am Ende sind wir doch nicht nach Italien gefahren&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 결국 이탈리아에 가지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">sind</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">nach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">gefahren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">nicht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Italien</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Ende</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">doch</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wir sind am Ende doch nicht nach Italien gefahren.</b></div>문장 전체의 nicht는 방향을 나타내는 말(nach Italien) 앞에 와요 (45과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fbc454c75c\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Der Verein bedarf <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) dringende Hilfe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) dringendem Hilfe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) dringenden Hilfe</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) dringender Hilfe</button></div><div class=\"qe\">bedürfen은 2격을 받아요. 관사 없는 2격 여성은 형용사 어미 -er예요 (46과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"7c4e367f76\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;abgeschlossen&quot;],[&quot;hatte&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Nach dem Abschluss ihres Studiums zog sie nach Hamburg.<br>→ Nachdem sie ihr Studium <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:15ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(abschließen · 과거분사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(보조 동사)</span>, zog sie nach Hamburg.</div><div class=\"qko\">학업을 마친 뒤 그녀는 함부르크로 이사했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Nach dem Abschluss ihres Studiums zog sie nach Hamburg.<br>→ Nachdem sie ihr Studium <b>abgeschlossen</b> <b>hatte</b>, zog sie nach Hamburg.</div>nach → nachdem. 주문장이 과거(zog)라서 nachdem 문장은 과거완료예요 (38과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"fcfb9b71b3\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"4\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">빨리 해결되리라는 가족의 바람은 이루어지지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Hoffnung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Familie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">für</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">eine</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">schnelle</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">Lösung</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">wurde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">enttäuscht.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Die Hoffnung der Familie auf eine schnelle Lösung wurde enttäuscht.</b></div>동사가 받던 전치사는 명사도 그대로 받아요. hoffen auf → die Hoffnung auf (39과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"c51805b829\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Parlament hat entschieden.&quot;,&quot;Das Parlament hat sich entschieden.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 기능동사 구문을 동사 하나로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Das Parlament hat eine Entscheidung getroffen.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 21\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Parlament hat entschieden.</b></div>eine Entscheidung treffen = entscheiden. 시제는 현재완료 그대로예요 (40과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"25eeaf5436\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Die von der Jury ausgewählten Filme werden nächste Woche gezeigt&quot;,&quot;Nächste Woche werden die von der Jury ausgewählten Filme gezeigt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">심사 위원단이 고른 영화들은 다음 주에 상영돼요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Filme</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">werden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Jury</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Woche</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">ausgewählten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">nächste</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">gezeigt</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Die von der Jury ausgewählten Filme werden nächste Woche gezeigt.</b></div>분사구 von der Jury ausgewählten은 관사 die와 명사 Filme 사이에 들어가요 (41과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"14eb3af0f8\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"8\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그녀는 그 책을 삼촌에게서 선물로 받았어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Sie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Buch</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">von</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">ihrem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">Onkel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">geschenkt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">geworden.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Sie hat das Buch von ihrem Onkel geschenkt bekommen.</b></div>받는 사람이 주어면 bekommen 수동이에요. 완료형은 hat … geschenkt bekommen이에요 (42과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"43780df720\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Jeder Autofahrer ist verpflichtet, bei einem Unfall zu helfen.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> müssen을 verpflichtet sein으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Jeder Autofahrer muss bei einem Unfall helfen.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 24\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Jeder Autofahrer ist verpflichtet, bei einem Unfall zu helfen.</b></div>müssen = verpflichtet sein, … zu. 본동사는 zu 부정형으로 끝에 와요 (43과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"9f05c2b819\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Egal wie viel es kostet wir reparieren das Dach&quot;,&quot;Wir reparieren das Dach egal wie viel es kostet&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">돈이 얼마나 들든 우리는 지붕을 고쳐요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">viel</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Dach</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">es</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">reparieren</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">wie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Egal</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">kostet</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Egal, wie viel es kostet, wir reparieren das Dach.</b></div>egal, wie … = 얼마나 ~하든. 뒤의 주문장은 주어부터 시작해요 (44과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"3cad82e5ae\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;als&quot;],[&quot;zwar&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Der Umbau hat mehr gekostet, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(비교)</span> die Stadt geplant hatte, und <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(덧붙이기)</span> fast das Doppelte.</div><div class=\"qko\">개조 공사는 시가 계획한 것보다 돈이 더 들었어요, 그것도 거의 두 배가요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Umbau hat mehr gekostet, <b>als</b> die Stadt geplant hatte, und <b>zwar</b> fast das Doppelte.</div>비교의 als 문장과 und zwar로 덧붙이는 말은 문장 끝의 동사 뒤, 뒷자리에 와요 (45과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"0e832fa423\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"6\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리는 부서장인 포겔 씨를 만났어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">trafen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">uns</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">Herrn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Vogel,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">Leiter</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">Abteilung.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Wir trafen uns mit Herrn Vogel, dem Leiter der Abteilung.</b></div>동격은 앞 명사와 같은 격이에요. mit + 3격 → dem Leiter (46과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"27\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 27</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"